& [DelineationReview]
  + complete design formation for B0 protocol B1 preflight B2 writer B3 post-state evidence B4 independent review B5 rollback-or-quarantine and SWA-05 evidence handoff is inside
  + every implementation process filesystem evidence-root reviewer rollback cleanup commit push provider self-signature activation persistence remote FPGA Minecraft principal-worktree and topology M2C effect is outside
  + the boundary is structural because every stage has a separate commission capability partition producer and later activation signature reference

& [SemanticReview]
  + proposal means intended change metadata and never present physical state
  + preflight means current bounded observation under separately admitted authority and never future containment truth
  + mutation terminated means the exact child stopped and evidence is accounted; it never means correct clean complete accepted or reversible
  + post-state evidence means a bounded observed candidate state at capture and never current-world truth after capture
  + acceptance means eligible for later SWA-05 consideration and never publication
  + rollback verified means the exact expected recovery state was independently reobserved and never evidence erasure cleanup reuse or activation

& [AuthorityReview]
  + the closed capability enumeration prevents undefined capability kinds from hiding in generic effect labels
  + complete granted versus explicitly-not-granted partition prevents omission from being interpreted as permission
  + decoded metadata cannot instantiate a process filesystem root reviewer key or rollback carrier
  + StageReceipt is evidence from an admitted producer and cannot be used as a bearer capability
  + writer observer reviewer rollback executor publisher semantic signer and activating principal identities remain non-substitutable

& [LifecycleReview]
  + every stage transition binds the exact prior receipt and a new stage commission
  + B0 cannot emit B1 or later receipts and therefore a pure implementation cannot accidentally cross the physical boundary
  + B1 must be current and immediate before B2 rather than a saved structural receipt
  + B2 post-start faults preserve true or unknown may-have-mutated consequence
  + B3 and B5 require independent direct observation; B4 operates only on immutable B3 evidence

& [ValidationReview]
  + the closed order rejects malformed generation lineage commission capability replay and activation facts before any host-specific or physical interpretation
  + event and byte budgets are enforced before retention
  + direct inventory and reconciliation precede acceptance
  + deterministic review gates precede optional model judgment
  + nonauthority and unresolved frontier checks prevent a valid receipt from widening downstream scope

& [RequirementReview]
  + SWPB-001 through SWPB-020 are independent complete non-overlapping enough to test and collectively cover the source
  + C01 through C24 are hard and map into canonical clauses
  + T01 through T18 have structural refusals and future adversarial fixture routes
  + seven folds converge without unresolved semantic formation issue

